      "name": "Fleet Coordinated Takeoff and Formation (3 Drones)",
      "content": "Three-drone coordination exercise: Drone 2, Drone 1, and Drone 3 take off together to 19 meters altitude, then hold formation at positions (522, 456, 19), (841, 529, 19), and (513, 826, 19) respectively for synchronized operation. Then all three drones move north for 67m, and next move east for 62m. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (north 67m, then east 62m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
