        "Three-drone coordinated maneuver: Drone 2, Drone 1, and Drone 3 lift off to 19m elevation, hold formation positions at (522, 456, 19), (841, 529, 19), and (513, 826, 19) respectively, then travel north 67 meters and east 62 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
      ],
