      "content": "Drone 1 performs an extreme marathon flight. Take off to 29 meters, fly to start point (98, 102, 29), then zigzag across the full map through 20 intermediate waypoints: (114, 151, 29), (852, 212, 29), (183, 228, 29), (782, 332, 29), (144, 414, 29), (897, 446, 29), (176, 522, 29), (809, 678, 29), (165, 744, 29), (959, 788, 29), (146, 864, 29), (810, 874, 29), (518, 773, 29), (924, 552, 29), (77, 597, 29), (964, 416, 29), (119, 381, 29), (829, 129, 29), (262, 943, 29), (730, 467, 29). Avoid obstacles Ellipse Obstacle 2, Ellipse Obstacle 1, and Circle Obstacle 1. Finally, fly to end point (907, 924, 29) and land.",
