      "Execute synchronized operation with Drone 2, Drone 1, Drone 3: take off reaching 19 meters height, maintain formation at coordinates (522, 456, 19), (841, 529, 19), and (513, 826, 19) respectively, then proceed north for 67m and subsequently east for 62m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
      "Three-drone coordinated maneuver: Drone 2, Drone 1, and Drone 3 lift off to 19m elevation, hold formation positions at (522, 456, 19), (841, 529, 19), and (513, 826, 19) respectively, then travel north 67 meters and east 62 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
