  {
    "id": "1ea3e9a3",
    "name": "Fleet Target Sweep (3 Drones)",
    "content": "Three-drone target sweep: Drone 1, Drone 3, and Drone 2 take off together to 18 meters altitude. Drone 1 flies to target Circle Target 2, Drone 3 flies to target Polygon Target 1, and Drone 2 flies to target Circle Target 1. After reaching the targets, all three drones move west for 73m, then south for 46m, then north for 64m together. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (west 73m, south 46m, north 64m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
