      "Coordinate Drone 2, Drone 1, and Drone 3: ascend together to 19 meters, establish formation at positions (522, 456, 19), (841, 529, 19), and (513, 826, 19) respectively, then execute coordinated movement north 67m followed by east 62m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (north 67m, east 62m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
      "Three-drone formation drill: launch Drone 2, Drone 1, and Drone 3 to altitude 19m, hold stations at (522, 456, 19), (841, 529, 19), and (513, 826, 19) respectively, then shift north by 67 meters and east by 62 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
