  {
    "id": "1ea3e9a3",
    "name": "Fleet Target Sweep (3 Drones)",
    "content": "Three-drone target sweep: Drone 1, Drone 3, and Drone 2 take off together to 18 meters altitude. Drone 1 flies to target Circle Target 2, Drone 3 flies to target Polygon Target 1, and Drone 2 flies to target Circle Target 1. After reaching the targets, all three drones move west for 73m, then south for 46m, then north for 64m together. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (west 73m, south 46m, north 64m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
    "content_aliases": [
      "Coordinate Drone 1, Drone 3, and Drone 2: ascend together to 18 meters altitude, send Drone 1 to target Circle Target 2, Drone 3 to target Polygon Target 1, and Drone 2 to target Circle Target 1, then execute coordinated sweep movement west 73m, south 46m, and north 64m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (west 73m, south 46m, north 64m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
      "Three-drone target sweep operation: launch Drone 1, Drone 3, and Drone 2 to altitude 18m, navigate to targets Circle Target 2, Polygon Target 1, Circle Target 1 respectively, then shift west by 73 meters, south by 46 meters, and north by 64 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
      "Execute three-drone sweep mission: Drone 1, Drone 3, Drone 2 take off reaching 18 meters height, fly to targets Circle Target 2, Polygon Target 1, Circle Target 1 respectively, then proceed west for 73m, subsequently south for 46m, and finally north for 64m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
      "Three-drone coordinated target mission: Drone 1, Drone 3, and Drone 2 lift off to 18m elevation, reach targets Circle Target 2, Polygon Target 1, Circle Target 1 respectively, then travel west 73 meters, south 46 meters, and north 64 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
    ],
    "description": "Three drones visit targets, then sweep west, south, and north",
